# PairYE3T/Kokkos device-plan upload and direct run-0 probe.

units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
atom_modify map yes sort 0 0.0
newton on

variable a equal 3.300
lattice bcc ${a}
region cell block 0 2 0 2 0 2 units lattice
create_box 1 cell
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 180.94788
reset_atoms id sort yes

neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

pair_style ye3t/kk/device chunksize 256 block_policy direct
pair_coeff * * ${model} Ta

run 0
